{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29239","headline":"和李相国 · 许浑","name":"和李相国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨实珍吴果，驯雏重越禽。\n摘来渔浦上，携在兔园阴。\n霜合凝丹颊，风披敛素襟。\n刀分琼液散，笼簌雪华深。\n虎帐斋中设，龙楼洛下吟。\n含消兼受彩，应贵冢卿心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}